    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>1级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 类人生物（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 15，''强韧'' 12，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 12</span><span>''侦查'' +1</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}标枪（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+6vs.AC<br>命中：4 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}标枪（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 10（一个生物）+6vs.AC<br>命中：4 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">狡诈✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该狗头人快步一格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">死里逃生✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：一次近程或区域攻击对该狗头人命中或失手。<br>效果（直觉打断）：该狗头人快步最多三格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 8（-1）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 12（+1）</span><span>''智力'' 9（-1）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+0）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，龙语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，3 把标枪</span></div></div>\n</div>",
